      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Leyenda:\n  azul    — fuente / nodo perdurable\n  morado  — etapas del pipeline\n  verde   — estados terminales OK\n  rojo    — estado terminal Failed\n  ambar   — decision / fallback\n  dashed  — path de fallback (backup actor)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Leyenda:\n  azul    — fuente / nodo perdurable\n  morado  — etapas del pipeline\n  verde   — estados terminales OK\n  rojo    — estado terminal Failed\n  ambar   — decision / fallback\n  dashed  — path de fallback (backup actor)",
